  "Build a game with Oort NX on your Mac, then add its folder here or send it with a cable. Your games, saves and settings stay on this device.": {
   "localizations": {
    "en": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Build a game with Oort NX on your Mac, then add its folder here or send it with a cable. Your games, saves and settings stay on this device."
     }
    },
    "fr": {
     "stringUnit": {
      "state": "translated",
      "value": "Compile un jeu avec Oort NX sur ton Mac, puis ajoute son dossier ici ou envoie-le par câble. Tes jeux, sauvegardes et réglages restent sur cet appareil."
     }
    }
   }
  },
